{
  "id": "periodic-he-dft",
  "name": {
    "ja": "周期HeのKS-LDA：Γ点・kメッシュ・基底・SCF",
    "en": "Periodic-He KS-LDA: Gamma, k meshes, basis and SCF"
  },
  "problem_id": "periodic-he-dft",
  "method_ids": [
    "kohn-sham-dft",
    "electronic-bases",
    "scf",
    "xc-functionals",
    "pseudopotentials",
    "k-point"
  ],
  "scope": {
    "ja": "固定した1原子単純立方Heセル（格子定数4 bohr、価電子2、非偏極LDA_X＋VWN5、局所GTH）。PySCFを使う実行・検証ワークフロー。11設定でk点・Gaussian軌道基底・FFT補助格子・SCFを別々に比較し、Γ／2³は独立DFTK平面波参照と照合。平衡He結晶・完全基底・金属・一般物質は未検証。",
    "en": "Fixed one-atom simple-cubic He cell (lattice constant 4 bohr, two valence electrons, unpolarized LDA_X plus VWN5, local GTH). A PySCF execution/validation workflow. Eleven settings separately compare k sampling, Gaussian orbital basis, auxiliary FFT grid and SCF; Gamma and 2³ are compared with independent DFTK plane waves. Equilibrium helium, complete-basis, metals and general materials remain unvalidated."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "固定中性セル・2電子閉殻、整数占有。Γ中心の分率k座標と一様重みを保存。同一のGTH係数・Libxc汎関数で独立DFTKと比較し、エネルギー原点のフィットはしない。",
    "en": "Fixed neutral two-electron closed-shell cell with integer occupations. Explicit Gamma-centered fractional k coordinates and equal weights. Independent DFTK uses identical GTH coefficients and Libxc functionals; no fitted energy shifts."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "原子単位系：距離bohr、エネルギーhartree／基本セル、波数は逆bohr。分率k座標は逆格子基底での値。",
    "en": "Atomic units: distances in bohr, energies in hartree per primitive cell and wavevectors in inverse bohr. Fractional k coordinates use reciprocal-lattice units."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "3次元Bloch周期境界。セル内He 1原子、価電子2、点電荷イオンのEwald項を含む中性セル。",
    "en": "Three-dimensional Bloch periodic boundaries. One He atom and two valence electrons per neutral primitive cell, including the ionic Ewald term."
  },
